{"id":"3034781c857fdfd7","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation.md","title":"Consistency Strength Depends on the Binumeration","display":"thm-consistency-numeration-variation — Consistency Strength Depends on the Binumeration","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation","aliases":["67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation"],"display":"thm-consistency-numeration-variation — Consistency Strength Depends on the Binumeration","depends_on":["[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 8(a),(b)","source_printed_pages":"30","source_pdf_pages":"41","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-consistency-numeration-variation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistency-numeration-variation — Consistency Strength Depends on the Binumeration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 8(a),(b)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"30"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(z)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\">\\(\\tau(z)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中的双表示。其元语言谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Binum}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Binum}_T\\)</span> 及相关接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一自然证明算术化；任意候选公理公式都至多有自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>。记此公式域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{z\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]=\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{z\\}\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为标准算术模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为固定编号。第二行的真值与蕴涵均为额外的显式条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau&#39;,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;})\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(T\\nvdash(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models\\pi\\land T\\vdash(\\pi\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\exists\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau&#39;,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\\land\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\pi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau&#39;,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;})\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(T\\nvdash(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau)\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\bigl(\\mathbb N\\models\\pi\\land T\\vdash(\\pi\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau)\\bigr)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\exists\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[z]\\quad\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau&#39;,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\\land\\bigl(T\\vdash(\\pi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau&#39;})\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.8(a),(b), p.30（PDF 41）；已目视核对两项蕴涵方向。即使只允许 PR 双表示，一致性句也可严格变弱；真 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句若在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中蕴涵原一致性句，还能由另一个 PR 双表示的一致性句实现。</p>\n<p>(a) 的自指公理公式禁止超过第一个“新一致性蕴涵旧一致性”的证明；若逆蕴涵可证，公式将退化为固定有限片段，从而使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明原一致性，违反二不完全性。(b) 先将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 正规化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\delta(y)\">\\(\\forall y\\delta(y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 为 PR，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau&#39;(z)=\\tau(z)\\lor\\exists y\\le z\\neg\\delta(y)\">\\(\\tau&#39;(z)=\\tau(z)\\lor\\exists y\\le z\\neg\\delta(y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 的标准真实性保证逐数双表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\pi\">\\(\\neg\\pi\\)</span> 则使公理公式最终接受所有句子，故其一致性恰有指定强度。这里不把真实性条件省略或降为仅仅 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内的可证性。源证明已读，全部自指及 PR 正规化基础未独立形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerp